{
  "id": "RAW_d3be0e6f43",
  "title": "刚刚，蚂蚁 OceanBase 推湖库一体 AI 数据平台！AI 业务收入首破亿",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MTQ4NjQzMw==&mid=2652814894&idx=2&sn=17cf2f3ad6ffb33bc4c67538520e8428",
  "date": "2026-11-24 14:24:00",
  "author": "智东西",
  "siteName": "智东西",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>李水青</span> <span>2026-11-24 14:24</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_f63395c.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px;white-space: normal;\">\n   <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 150\" style=\"display:block;\" overflow=\"hidden\">\n    <image href=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dUMUxwSibzuxrsXYvED9aCH3rktqiaQvJHVficLjR9ibPrMUkT9s4WUcDO9AzBlVeTuIjMPtj3RRvzwPppKXVQFCwMl7QWwSMBZt5c6uGgGvp0o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" width=\"680\" height=\"150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n     <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0,0; 0,0; -680,0; -680,0\" keyTimes=\"0; 0.5; 0.5; 1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"discrete\"></animateTransform>\n    </image>\n    <image href=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dUMUxwSibzuwFrJian8EEAj0kpzIp54WnOibdBZyib861hLibMeGkCaVe0F5vJiceGia07TA3PdibWyWlgE571tSiaXGQM99QzV06p3gph2pBXPGFibiao/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" width=\"680\" height=\"150\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" transform=\"translate(680, 0)\">\n     <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"680,0; 680,0; 0,0; 0,0\" keyTimes=\"0; 0.5; 0.5; 1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"discrete\"></animateTransform>\n    </image>\n   </svg>\n   <span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.42592592592592593\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_ab95a8e.png\"></span>\n  </p>\n  <div style=\"margin: 15px 8px 35px;\">\n   <p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;line-height: normal;font-size: 15px;padding: 0 10px;border-left: 3.5px solid #00b0ec;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">为Agent造底座：敢试错、跑得省、多模混合搜。</span></strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 8px 7.5px;white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-align: right;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">作者 | &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"display: inline-block;width: 63px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\">李水青</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 10px 8px 35px;white-space: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-align: right;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">编辑 | &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"display: inline-block;width: 63px;text-align: left;\"><span leaf=\"\">云鹏</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">智东西11月24日报道，刚刚，在蚂蚁OceanBase AI数据大会上，OceanBase正式推出AI战略产品——</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">湖库一体AI数据平台OceanLake</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，并宣布向全球</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">开源其核心引擎AI数据库OceanSeek。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanBase CEO杨冰谈道，AI时代的数据基础设施应坚持“</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">湖库一体、多模融合、Agent友好、开源开放</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">”四大原则。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_15571d2.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">基于这一判断，OceanLake为湖库一体架构，融合</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">数据库实时事务、数仓分析、数据湖开放存储</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">能力，统一管理</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">多模态数据</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，支持</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">离线加工、在线分析检索与Agent应用</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，实现离在线一体化。</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">OceanLake平台的全景图</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">如下所示，覆盖数据与计算层、业务语义层、Agent运行层、数据智能层多层架构。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_95c7453.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">会上，OceanBase&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI数据库OceanSeek</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">也宣布开源。杨冰称，这应该是</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">业界第一个支持生产级AI落地、基于湖库一体和存算分离架构的开源AI数据库。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_d2222d6.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanBase CTO杨传辉透露，OceanBase不仅在深耕的OLTP、OLAP场景取得TPC-DS、TPC-H 世界第一，在第三类负载</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">混合搜索</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">也实现业内</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">主流开源SOTA</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;（行业最佳水平）。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在测评中，OceanBaseAI数据库在</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">全文搜索</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">Top100与Top1000各项吞吐以及</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">条件搜索</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">各测试项吞吐均</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">大幅超越Elasticsearch 9.4.2。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_a5120b1.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">亿级向量测试</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">中，OceanBaseAI数据库吞吐最高约为Elasticsearch的</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">17.3倍</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">；在TPC-DS 100T测试中，</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">数据分支</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">创建时间为</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">1.345秒</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">，实现了数据分支</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒级返回。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_1e61a69.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanLake的能力已在多个产业场景落地，比如其为</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波、灵心巧手</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">等打通多模态数据处理与模型训练链路；帮助</span><span style=\"color: #0f59a4;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">平安寿险</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">用AI“读懂”保险，将典型取数交付时间从2—5天缩短至约15分钟等。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">直面数据 “三座冰山”：</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanLake四大特性定义AI数据底座</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">近年来，大量真实AI需求爆发，政企客户对AI数据基础设施的真实需求也逐渐显现。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">杨冰在演讲中谈到，以蚂蚁内部应用为例，通过蚂蚁灵光、蚂蚁阿福、商家晓雨和蚂蚁灵波四大业务的落地实践，OceanBase归纳出三个需求焦点：统一的多模态数据底座、Agent数据底座和数据智能。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_7fa6b3d.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">实际上，这不仅是蚂蚁的特有需求，更与OceanBase看到的绝大多数客户需求具有相似性：随着模型能力不断提升，数据成为新的瓶颈。团队观察到，企业的智能化转型远不及预期：模型能力商品化完成，低枝果实几乎被摘完，数据飞轮还没有转起来。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">杨冰进一步将企业数据生产力释放的困境总结为“三座冰山”：公有数据相对于私有数据、结构化数据相对于多模态数据、有序数据相对于乱序数据，都是冰山之上的一角，而冰山之下的数据价值有待挖掘。这些冰山下数据问题的解决，将直击模型使用中的“无米之炊”问题。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_305ad43.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">那么再回到那个问题：AI时代的数据基础设施应该长成什么样？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">杨冰谈道，AI时代的数据基础设施应该具有以下四大特征：</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1、湖库一体：统一存储全量业务数据，还要支持离线、在线一体化计算。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2、多模融合：能基于业务语义，对多模态数据进行统一治理，通过混合搜索成为可计算、可利用的资产。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3、Agent 友好：具备效果观测与评测、长期与共享记忆、权限治理等能力，支撑Agent的规模化运行和自我进化。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">4、开源开放：支持开放计算和多模型调用，适配多种基础设施和异构芯片混合部署，以应对复杂的计算环境和快速变化的技术需求。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">基于上述判断，OceanBase在会上正式发布面向AI时代的战略产品——湖库一体AI数据平台OceanLake。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanLake技术详解：</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">湖库合体、本体自建，Agent底座落地</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanLake采用湖库一体架构，融合数据库的实时事务处理、数据仓库的分析计算与数据湖的开放存储能力，统一管理结构化、半结构化和非结构化等多模态数据。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">企业可以在同一开放平台上开发和治理数据，开展离线批量加工，并将加工成果直接用于在线分析、检索和Agent应用，实现离在线一体。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">1、湖库一体，让Agent敢试错、跑得省</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanBase CTO杨传辉解读道，当用户从人变为Agent，我们不仅看到底层硬件需求大幅提升、AI场景访问量呈数量级提高，也看到在业务AI化和AI新品场景中，在线和离线的边界正变得模糊。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在这种需求驱动下，湖库一体成为面向Agent的现代数据架构。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_96b5ecc.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这样的数据库支持在离线融合，一份数据支持多种业务负载；支持弹性与试错，基于对象存储的存算分离架构是自然选择；支持多模态，一张表统一处理结构化与非结构化数据。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Agent友好需成为AI Data Infra的原生能力。比如，数据库需要数据分支支持， 实现Agent安全试错，从而完成秒级创建、读写隔离、失败可回滚；需要逻辑表功能，支持海量Agent低成本运行，实现逻辑隔离、按需唤醒、闲时资源归零。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">同时，多模混合搜索也将成为一类工具负载：用户能看到一张多模表，融合结构化与无结构化数据；混合搜索支持统一召回，一次查询融合多路能力；先过滤，再调用模型，再节省token的同时让结果更可控。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_d6e2af8.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些真实的体验和效率变化，正是OceanLake面向Agent应用为客户带来的新价值。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_d2120b5.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanLake引擎是面向AI数据生产的一体化引擎，目前已用于一些线下客户，也即将推出云上版本。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_e47a871.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">某头部保险公司客户基于OceanLake处理海量多模态文件，输出Token减少达到78.6%，提取准确率从原来的60%提升至现在的97%。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_fa550f2.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波基于OceanLake处理海量具身智能数据，对象存储读取量减少97%，对象存储的带宽已不再是瓶颈；千亿级标量与百亿级标签的混合检索能达到15.7ms。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_ae320a5.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">2、本体语义“自下而上”，AI底座告别堆人力</span></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">前面谈的是数据和计算引擎， 而AI数据基础设施的发展还需要本体语义。杨传辉认为，这将成为AI基础设施的原生能力。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">提到本体语义，很多人会想到Palantier，其通过自上而下的方式让专家来说数据标注，大量依赖人工，因此很难在中小企业乃至中国广大公司复制。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_4224a0e.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanBase选择自下而上去构建本体，这一路径至少面临数据的获取与加工、本体的自动构建、知识的更新迭代三重挑战，这本质都是数据层的挑战，也是OceanBase可以去原生构建的能力。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">为此，OceanBase推出企业级Agentic本体语义平台——OceanBase Ontoss。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_e3fc65d.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">该平台支持多源自动建模及人工交互补齐，能够沉淀本地消费、业务本体及企业资产，据称能达到10倍级的本体构建效率提升，让人力投入减少90%，本体构建成本减少90%。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">基于此，OceanBase还正式推出OceanBase DataPilot云服务。该服务支持开箱即用，助用户搭建AI原生的企业数据应用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_24f363d.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">厦门航空基于OceanBase DataPilot实现了智能问数与智能洞察，将取数链路从7个环节缩减为1次对话，分析耗时从5天缩短到3分钟，准确率提升至超95%，根因场景覆盖率超85%。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_451ce31.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">除了OceanLake的升级，杨传辉还谈及了OceanBase分布式数据库和OceanBase集中式数据库的持续迭代，这些产品都在从能用变得更加好用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_27b5112.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">OceanBase近五年复合增长超 60%</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;AI与全球化成新增长点</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">杨冰在会上公布了一组最新数据：OceanBase近五年复合增长率超60%，AI与全球化成为新的增长点。其中，2026年AI营收已经超过1亿。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_f902dce.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">聚焦金融领域，OceanBase对政策性银行的覆盖达到100%、万亿银行覆盖占70%；头部保险覆盖达95%、头部证券覆盖达90%、头部基金覆盖达65%；金融行业分布式数据库市场份额市占率达到30%，居于全国第一位。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_237066a.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">聚焦政企领域，OceanBase 2026年政企行业持续突破，在数字政府领域实现“部-省-市-区”全贯通；同时覆盖1/3核心央企，涉及数百家央企关键业务。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_3ee89a5.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">在公有云领域，OceanBase营收增长达80%，AI加速落地；全球化方向，海外营收占比达到15%，全球化客户数增速达300%。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box;padding: 0 8px;margin-top:-10px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: middle;display: block;margin: 0 auto;width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124144307_63a89cc.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">生态成为收入贡献主力，伙伴贡献收入占比达75%，伙伴收入增长达100%，覆盖超1000家各行业伙伴。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">04</span></em></strong></span><span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 40px;color: #00b0ec;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><em style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">.</span></em></strong></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">结语：头部数据库</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.5px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\">加速向Agent基础设施厂商进化</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">从分布式数据库和核心交易系统出发，向企业全量数据管理、Agent数据供给和数据服务拓展，OceanBase与海外头部AI数据公司Databricks类似，都在走向企业Agent基础设施厂商的同一个终点。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 15px 8px 25px;white-space: normal;line-height: 28px;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><span leaf=\"\">随着产业进入高速成长的黄金起步阶段，资本也在汇聚。Databricks刚刚于8月完成了50亿美元融资，投后估值达1900亿美元；OceanBase也于7月底传出正与洽谈20亿至30亿元A轮融资。新的资金补给有望进一步推动这些企业向AI数据平台领域拓展，为AI Agent产业发展提供助力。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-bottom: 12px;margin-top: -18px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_d76335a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2796296296296296\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border: 0.3px solid #d8d8d8;display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260724150830_e590fd2.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:22px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_5cf34da.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7064814814814815\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"border: 0.3px solid #d8d8d8;display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_220898f.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"min-height: auto !important;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px;text-align: center;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.023148148148148147\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display:block;border-radius: 5px;vertical-align: top;visibility: visible !important;width: 100%;height: auto !important;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260719015445_5cf34da.png\"></p>\n  <p class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"智东西\" data-alias=\"zhidxcom\" data-from=\"0\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/z7ZD1WagSLg1QQZ9WhzKFpoX6M9OFR8lZIbyhXWlLeyDm8kcJHPOt2FibQeibbonAAYAPyaCwZ4Y0RborxHic3ryQ/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"智东西，AI产业新媒体，专注报道人工智能的前沿技术发展，和技术应用带来的千行百业产业变革。我们的slogan是：聚焦AI前沿 服务产业变革。\" data-id=\"MzA4MTQ4NjQzMw==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\" data-service_type=\"1\" data-verify_status=\"2\"></mp-common-profile></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "蚂蚁 OceanBase 正式推出湖库一体 AI 数据平台 OceanLake 并开源 AI 数据库 OceanSeek，宣布 AI 业务收入首破亿元，凸显其在 AI 数据基础设施领域的布局。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "蚂蚁 OceanBase 正式推出湖库一体 AI 数据平台 OceanLake 并开源 AI 数据库 OceanSeek，宣布 AI 业务收入首破亿元，凸显其在 AI 数据基础设施领域的布局。",
  "summary": "蚂蚁 OceanBase 在 AI 数据大会上正式发布湖库一体 AI 数据平台 OceanLake，并开源核心引擎 AI 数据库 OceanSeek。OceanLake 融合数据库实时事务、数仓分析和数据湖开放存储能力，统一管理多模态数据，支持离线加工、在线分析检索与 Agent 应用。OceanSeek 在全文搜索和向量检索性能上均超越 Elasticsearch 9.4.2，在亿级向量测试中吞吐最高约为 Elasticsearch 的 17.3 倍。平台已在蚂蚁灵波、灵心巧手等场景落地，帮助平安寿险将典型取数交付时间从 2-5 天缩短至约 15 分钟。OceanBase 年复合增长率超 60%，2026 年 AI 营收超过 1 亿元。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "湖库一体架构融合多种数据处理能力",
      "explanation": "OceanLake 统一管理结构化、半结构化和非结构化数据，支持离线批量加工和在线分析检索，实现离在线一体化，为 Agent 应用提供数据底座。"
    },
    {
      "point": "OceanSeek AI 数据库性能卓越",
      "explanation": "在全文搜索 Top100/Top1000 吞吟以及条件搜索测试中均大幅超越 Elasticsearch 9.4.2，亿级向量测试吞吐最高约为 Elasticsearch 的 17.3 倍，TPC-DS 100T 测试中数据分支创建时间仅为 1.345 秒。"
    },
    {
      "point": "平台已在实际场景中验证价值",
      "explanation": "蚂蚁灵波处理海量具身智能数据，对象存储读取量减少 97%；平安寿险用 AI 读懂保险，典型取数交付时间从 2-5 天缩短至约 15 分钟，准确率提升至 97%。"
    },
    {
      "point": "OceanBase 持续高速增长并布局 AI",
      "explanation": "近五年复合增长率超 60%，2026 年 AI 营收超过 1 亿元，金融领域分布式数据库市场份额居全国第一，生态伙伴收入占比达 75%。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "为 Agent 造底座：敢试错、跑得省、多模混合搜。",
